const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文说明在存在市场微观结构影响时，如何用高频成交或报价观测实施已实现核以估计个股日波动。 阅读时应将其放回原始样本、时点和制度环境中理解，不能把问题本身当作跨市场结论。",en:"The article explains practical use of realized kernels to estimate daily volatility from high-frequency trade or quote observations when market microstructure effects are present. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1368-423x.2008.00275.x",label:{zh:"The Econometrics Journal · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"The Econometrics Journal · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"它比较同一股票的成交和报价估计，并讨论局部价格趋势等挑战，因此观测类型、清洗、采样、核函数和交易时段规则都很关键。 比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系共同构成研究合同；改变其中任一选择，可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It compares trade- and quote-based estimates for the same stocks and discusses challenging local trends, making observation type, cleaning, sampling, kernel, and session rules essential. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1368-423x.2008.00275.x",label:{zh:"The Econometrics Journal · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"The Econometrics Journal · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"需要带时间戳的成交或报价、价格与报价字段、交易所日历、证券标识、采样同步规则、更正标记和明确的核函数选择。 字段定义、可得时点和样本筛选必须与原研究分开记录，不能因变量同名或使用最新修订值便视为可比。",en:"Inputs require timestamped trades or quotes, price and quote fields, exchange-session calendars, security identifiers, sampling and synchronization rules, correction flags, and stated kernel choices. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1368-423x.2008.00275.x",label:{zh:"The Econometrics Journal · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"The Econometrics Journal · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"来源展示已实现核如何在高频观测上实施，不能让任意五分钟K线成为逐笔成交或报价记录的等价替代。 它只支持来源描述的经验或理论关系，不能把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"The source shows how realized-kernel estimates can be implemented on high-frequency observations; it does not make any five-minute bar an equivalent substitute for the underlying trade or quote record. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not turn association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1368-423x.2008.00275.x",label:{zh:"The Econometrics Journal · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"The Econometrics Journal · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"区分成交与报价；保留交易所和接收时钟；定义交易时段与竞价处理；记录异常更正规则；结果前确定核与带宽；检查局部趋势。 开展后续分析前，应将这些选择写入版本化研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Separate trades from quotes; retain exchange and receive clocks; define session and auction treatment; document outlier and correction rules; choose kernel and bandwidth before results; and inspect local price trends. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1368-423x.2008.00275.x",label:{zh:"The Econometrics Journal · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"The Econometrics Journal · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 The Econometrics Journal · DOI record。该方法估计的是既定数据和噪声假设下的历史变动，而不是可执行波动率预测或全部流动性与执行成本的度量。 如需数值结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites The Econometrics Journal · DOI record. The method estimates historical variation under its data and noise assumptions, not an executable volatility forecast or a measure of all liquidity and execution costs. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1368-423x.2008.00275.x",label:{zh:"The Econometrics Journal · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"The Econometrics Journal · DOI record · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Realized Kernels in Practice: Trades and Quotes”公开说明的研究对象、设计与适用边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。该方法估计的是既定数据和噪声假设下的历史变动，而不是可执行波动率预测或全部流动性与执行成本的度量。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Realized Kernels in Practice: Trades and Quotes”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
